      },
      {
        "role": "ai",
        "content": "The features of Joboro.ai as described in the provided documents include:\n\n1. **Job Posting and Distribution**: Recruiters can post job vacancies on multiple external job boards.\n2. **AI-Powered CV Parsing and Candidate Ranking**: The system parses uploaded CVs/resumes to extract structured data, scores candidates based on role criteria, and ranks them accordingly.\n3. **Multi-Stage Screening Workflows**: Configurable workflows for different stages of the hiring process (written tests, AI interviews, human interviews).\n4. **AI Audio and Video Interviews**: Candidates can complete interviews via video or audio with domain, cognitive, language, and non-verbal competence scoring.\n5. **Candidate Pipeline Management**: A Kanban view to manage candidate pipelines, smart filters for searching and sorting candidates, tagging and grouping of candidates, and timeline tracking for each candidate's journey.\n6. **Team Collaboration Features**: Hiring panels can collaborate through the platform.\n7. **ATS Integration and Onboarding Sync**: The system integrates with Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) and syncs onboarding processes.\n8. **Hiring Analytics, Audit Trails, and Compliance Reporting**: Provides analytics dashboards, audit trails for all actions, and compliance reporting.\n9. **Dual Portal**: A Recruiter dashboard and a Candidate portal.\n\nThese features collectively enable the platform to automate job posting, manage candidate pipelines, conduct various types of interviews, integrate with external systems, provide hiring analytics, ensure compliance, and facilitate collaboration among team members.undefined",
        "timestamp": "2026-03-23T09:00:05.920Z"
