      },
      {
        "role": "ai",
        "content": "Based on the information provided in the Joboro.ai BRD v1.0 document:\n\n1. **Job Posting to External Boards**: One-click syndication of job postings across multiple external job boards.\n2. **Career Page Builder with Employer Branding**: Support for creating and customizing career pages that align with employer branding strategies.\n3. **Knockout Criteria Auto-Disqualification**: Set criteria to automatically disqualify ineligible candidates based on predefined rules.\n4. **Candidate Screening & Evaluation**:\n   - Parse structured data from uploaded CVs/resumes (High).\n   - Score and rank candidates based on role-specific criteria (High).\n   - Administer written tests with configurable questions (High).\n   - Conduct AI-powered audio and video interviews (High).\n   - Evaluate candidates on domain, cognitive, language, and non-verbal competence (High).\n   - Apply bias control mechanisms to scoring algorithms (High).\n   - Support skill-based scoring and custom evaluation rubrics (Medium).\n5. **Pipeline & Workflow Management**:\n   - Multi-stage configurable hiring pipeline (High).\n   - Kanban view of candidate pipeline stages (Medium).\n   - Smart filters for searching and sorting candidates (Medium).\n   - Candidate tagging and grouping (Medium).\n   - Timeline tracking for each candidate's journey (Medium).\n   - Pipeline automation and AI-driven follow-up messages (High).\n6. **Interview & Scheduling**:\n   - Automated interview scheduling with calendar integration (High).\n   - AI conducts async video/audio interviews (High).\n   - Support human interview coordination within the platform (High).\n\nThese features collectively aim to streamline job posting, candidate screening, pipeline management, and overall recruitment process efficiency while ensuring compliance and fairness.undefined",
